      "id": "swiss-mono-index",
      "name": "Swiss Mono Index",
      "summary": "A precision-indexed portfolio or catalog site where strict column grids and monospaced type work together, labels, metadata, and category markers feel like a living specification document. The board's heaviest channels combine into a site that is rigorous, cold, and quietly authoritative. White fields, hairline rules, and character-grid spacing leave no room for decoration.",
